config BR2_PACKAGE_EXAMPLE_DAEMON
	bool "example-daemon"
	help
	  Minimal placeholder app (apps/example-daemon) demonstrating how
	  custom SpeakerPoint applications, developed under apps/ in this
	  same repo, are wired into the Buildroot package system. Copy
	  this package directory as a starting template for real apps -
	  see apps/README.md.
